# tunnel-route v1 (LOCKED GATE 3) — vars: {route}, {mood}, {features}
# model: flux_2 pro 1k, aspect 16:9 — reference art for tileset.prompt; not shipped raw
Pixel art game environment concept, walkable Caracas Metro tunnel between
stations: {route}. Mood: {mood}. Features along the way: {features}.
Concrete tube, parallel rails with safe walkway, cable bundles, maintenance
doors, dark encounter zones where wild spirit creatures faintly glow violet,
scattered work lights. GBA Pokemon FireRed era 3/4 top-down game perspective,
flat cel shading, crisp pixel art, limited palette dominated by concrete gray,
metro orange and spirit violet. No text, no watermark, no people.
